/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The software team are the experts in all code associated with the ROV and nonROV device. They made and adjusted the code necessary to map the thrusters to the controller. Python and Arduino are the main languages the software engineers used to program Nomad. The software engineers and electrical engineers were often collaborating and working closely together to guarantee a harmonious system.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
